{"id":"yop14zs7ye4z0dyeco2ppk58p","title":"生成宇宙学如何消除地月系统危机","originalTitle":"生成宇宙学是如何消除潮汐动力学在地月系统导致的危机的（前几博文总结）","summary":"生成宇宙学认为宇宙的膨胀和收缩循环进行，天体随宇宙同步膨胀，消除了传统潮汐动力学预测的地月相碰危机。考虑迟滞角变化后，计算得出月球后退速度为4.4厘米/年，消除了15亿年前的相碰危机。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3649650&do=blog&id=1561858"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T03:20:27.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T08:03:40.882Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T08:03:40.882Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["研究成果"],"score":22,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"4c5616d3-6255-4f5f-b7d5-8fb775a0e5e2","title":"生成宇宙学修正地月潮汐动力学消除碰撞危机"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"4c5616d3-6255-4f5f-b7d5-8fb775a0e5e2","title":"生成宇宙学修正地月潮汐动力学消除碰撞危机"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fB8rEGafV840","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}